WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
一张得奖照片，最先让你看见的是台上的那一秒。
A winning photo first shows you one moment on the podium.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.300
把镜头拉远，才看见练习、同伴和不同的起点。
Pull back to see practice, teammates, and different starting points.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:19.000
社会比较可以给你方向。比较之前，先问样本里漏了什么。
Social comparison can guide you. Ask what your comparison leaves out.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.100
同一个人，在熟悉的小组很健谈，在陌生场合很安静。
One person may speak freely in a familiar group and stay quiet among strangers.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:30.000
单次表现既跟人的倾向有关，也跟当时的情境有关。
One observation can reflect both tendencies and the situation.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.600
人格维度描述相对稳定的倾向，允许许多中间位置。
Trait dimensions describe relatively stable tendencies on a continuum.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.000
多看一些时候和场合里的行为，才能获得更有用的线索。
Behavior observed across times and settings gives more useful clues.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.800
把“我比他差”换成一件能观察、能练习的事。
Turn a global comparison into one observable action you can practice.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.000
比如这周让自己的开场比上周更清楚。
For example, make this week’s opening clearer than last week’s.
